      "content": "idk im just really uncomfortable. i tried rotating my hips and it felt like it released some of the pressure for a second. i feel like if i can just get through the initial tightness with some heavy stretching or maybe even a massage therapist who does deep tissue/cracking, it'll reset everything. it's probably just a muscle spasm right? i really dont want to deal with the doctors and the cost if i can just work it out myself here at home with some aggressive stretching. isn't movement better than just sitting there?",
